& [PriorConversationClarification] preserves already negotiated meaning without treating it as fresh user dictation
  + shared attention means transportable semantic state and repeated model passes rather than literal shared hidden state or KV cache
  + a canonical frame changes only through typed deltas based on an exact predecessor generation and digest
  + settlement requires a frozen candidate digest and explicit role-specific acknowledgements or challenges
  + attention capacity is divided among pinned anchors current focus retrieved associations recent stream and reserved headroom
  + excessive novelty invokes bounded backpressure rather than silent eviction of identity or authority anchors
  + imagination means exploring explicitly hypothetical branches derived from a sealed reality frame without granting them authority

